"video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Jump VR (virtual social world)", "keywords": ["SKT", "Social", "Jump", "Virtual", "avatar"], "long_description": "\u25b6'Avatar has personality, too'\nIn Jump VR, you can decorate your avatar with more cool and diverse items. Try a bold look you haven't tried in real life. Maybe some friends want to take a selfie together.\n\n\u25b6'Be a DJ now!'\nDJ-ing in a virtual club, dance and toast with a champagne, all to enjoy parties everyday, at any time. When your avatar is on stage, you will use your dancing skills.\n\n\u25b6'Let's play together, strangers'\nEnjoy lots of fun activities and be friends with other users, using darts, cakes, and fireworks which is all over the space. You can really communicate with voice chat / emoticons.\n\n\u25b6'Your own space, My Room'\nThere is also a cozy private space. Enjoy another VR service prepared by SKT in the My Room.\n\nLet's jump! into this virtual social world of \"Jump VR\".", "short_description": "A whole new VR social service! You can watch live game broadcasts with your unique Avatar friends and have a fun party in wonderful places in Jump VR!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "1142175572780058", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982451_380105959353683_2143421167283732480_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VpnwBrNm_pgQ7kNvwHgrgVW&_nc_oc=AdpKv6WYWUeiWwmD2qGeRs-4zs71rM8Eh-7RBNwGqR3ZxppPbl9wha1vQmw_yca6aOk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8Ul2HHGrTOpsQavydhqoU5CYsrPTEinUWgVnzesqyrNA&oe=6A2AD483"}, {"file_name": "z8scNk.png", "id": "644429759674085", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974526_644429766340751_3454542354810142720_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zW0A4--EVq4Q7kNvwFcQzHH&_nc_oc=AdrmN5nElatHREyNvOd9WTyhrLcWHzAIF3j0Ot-GPy